    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const lead=$('Get Lead').first().json;\nconst co=$('Get Company').first().json;\nif(!lead.lead_id) throw new Error('Lead not found in sheet: check lead_id');\nif(!lead.email) throw new Error('Lead has no email');\nconst prompt=['You are the sales quoting agent for '+co.company_name+'.','','PRICING RULES (follow these EXACTLY — never invent prices or discounts):',co.pricing_rules,'','BRAND VOICE:',co.brand_voice,'','LEAD REQUEST:',lead.message,'','Build the offer strictly from the pricing rules. Write the offer email in the brand voice. If the rules say never quote a dollar amount, do not include any prices — pitch the offer described in the rules instead.','Respond ONLY raw JSON, no markdown fences: {\"amount\": <total number, use 0 if no charge>, \"line_items\": \"<short summary of what is offered>\", \"email_subject\": \"<subject>\", \"email_body\": \"<body WITHOUT any accept link — it will be appended>\"}'].join('\\n');\nreturn [{json:{lead:lead,company:co,request_body:{model:co.ai_model||'claude-sonnet-4-6',max_tokens:1024,messages:[{role:'user',content:prompt}]}}}];"
      },
      "id": "067a53bd-dec2-4590-9bf0-8afda854689c",
      "name": "Build Quote Prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
